  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be very useful if there was an option in which you could put moods or any animations really, manually into a slot that gets marked as questionable content - what that means can be subjective.  \nThe point is so that people who have stuff that may not be kosher for streamers or lack of at home privacy, can hide everything that is under this flag.\nUsers with any respect, and the practice can be encouraged by staff and community, to put things that  might be in that grey area into the flag, so people can hide it on request without hiding absolutely everything based on rank (which means little).",
